// The layout engine's test suite, in the Foundation `Test`-construct shape.
//
// Every case builds a real tree, runs the two passes over it, and reads the
// frames back — the same path a host draws from. Run with:
//
//   kira test --backend vm tests/layout_kik
//   kira test --backend llvm tests/layout_kik
//
// Both backends must agree: the engine is ordinary Kira, and a geometry that
// differs between interpreting and compiling is a bug in one of them.
